# Android APK — fast build & install

Follow `.cursor/skills/android-apk-install/SKILL.md`. Test phone: `0015935A7000905`.

Default:

```bash
npm run android:install
```

Do **not** run `npx vite build` from a Cursor agent shell (hangs, 0% CPU, no logs). The script uses `CI=1 node ./node_modules/vite/bin/vite.js build`. New `lucide-react` icons must be exported from `src/lib/lucide.js` first.
